WEBVTT

00:26:58.079 --> 00:27:01.829
The indelible mark of the recession
doesn't just affect us individually.

00:27:02.329 --> 00:27:04.371
It can have a meaningful
impact on leaders

00:27:04.579 --> 00:27:06.996
and end up shaping entire organizations.

00:27:07.538 --> 00:27:12.746
It's very difficult for people who are
graduating recessions to avoid kind of

00:27:12.746 --> 00:27:16.871
the humbling adversity that that
type of environment presents.

00:27:17.246 --> 00:27:21.413
This brings us to a second surprise and
some more long term good news despite

00:27:21.413 --> 00:27:22.496
the short term headwinds

00:27:22.788 --> 00:27:26.663
in my data. I find that people who come
of age in recessions tend to be less

00:27:26.663 --> 00:27:33.079
narcissistic in terms of how they pay
themselves versus how their top leaders